:: WM_Lv1_Pickups
<%=window.gm.printPickup()%>
<%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qLocKey1==window.passage.name){%>
<p>This seems to be a storage room but most of the crates and barrels are broken and empty. </p>
    <%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey1==0){%>
    <div id='selectidx' > But some kind of <b>crank</b> is dangling on a hook mounted at the wall. Maybe its useful to operate some gear.
    <a0 onclick='window.gm.printTalkLink($("div#selectidx")[0],"div#choiceidxa"),window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey1=1'>Take it</a>
    </div><div id='choiceidxa' hidden>
    </div>
    <%}%>
<%}else if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qLocExit==window.passage.name){%>
    <p>There is a emergency hatch that should make for an <b>EXIT</b>. But it is closed. There is a winch next to it that should open the hatch. But it appears the manual crank is missing. Lets hope you can find it somewhere around. </p>
    <%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qFoundExit==0){window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qFoundExit=1%>
    <div id='selectidx' >
    <a0 onclick='window.gm.printTalkLink($("div#selectidx")[0],"div#choiceidxa")'>Memorize the location</a>
    </div><div id='choiceidxa' hidden> </div>
    <%}%>
    <%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey1==1){%>
    <p>As you have the crank you might try your luck to open the hatch and [[LEAVE|WM_Lv1_Exit]] this place.</p>
    <%}%>
<%}%>


:: WM_Lv1_Entry
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%window.gm.player.location=window.passage.name;%>
<p>The task that you were given is to find some mysterious crystals.</p>
<p>Unfortunatly the way you enterd is blocked by a rockslide. There should be an emergency exit in the lower floors of this excavation.</p>
<!--There is a control terminal next to the door. All lights are of except the <tgl id='lamp' value='blue' onclick='var x=this.attributes["value"].nodeValue;switch(x){case "blue":x="red";break;default:x="blue"}this.attributes["value"].nodeValue=this.style.color=this.textContent=x;'>blue</tgl> one.-->
[[Walk down the tunnel|WM_Lv1_A1]]
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


:: WM_Lv1_Exit
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%window.gm.player.location=window.passage.name;%>
<p>Lets see what you found so far:</p>
<div id="output"></div>
<br>
<a0 onclick='foo(true);window.story.show("WM_Home")'>Return Home</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>
<script>function foo(checkout){
    let msg="",x,SP=0,Coin=0;
    x=Object.keys(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.Explored).length;
    SP+=Math.floor(x/8);
    msg+="<p>Rooms explored: "+x.toString()+" = "+SP.toString()+"SP</p>";
    if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qKey1 && window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qFoundExit){ 
        SP+=1;
        msg+='<p>Found the Key and Exit =  +1 SP</p>';
    }
    if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.qBossState==3){
        SP+=1;
        msg+='<p>Escaped through the exit   =  +1 SP</p>'
    }
    Coin=SP*20;
    msg+='<p>Cash earned: '+Coin+'</p>'
    if(checkout){
        window.story.state.vars.qUnusedSP+=SP;
        window.story.state.vars.qCoin+=Coin;
    } else  window.gm.printOutput(msg)
}
foo(false)
</script>


:: WM_Lv1_VineSnare [_nosave_]
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<p>As you walk along, some tentacle push from the ground beneath you.</p>
<a0 onclick='window.gm.trialExploreEvt("Agility")'>Dodge away</a>
<a0 onclick='window.gm.trialExploreEvt("Strength")'>Stand still</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


:: WM_Lv1_VineSnare_Roll [_nosave_]
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_RollDebug")%>
<%if(s.tmp.args[2]==1 && s.vars.qLowerWear>0){s.vars.qLowerWear=0; %>
<p>Makeing a dodge roll you try to evade the tentacles gripping your legs but you just stumble. They grip your shorts and rip them off.
Now your lower body is <b>NAKED</b>. </p>
<%}else if(s.tmp.args[2]==1 && s.vars.qLowerWear==0){%>
<p>Quickly the tentacle entwine your legs. With quite some effort you make your escape but somehow their touch on your bare skin felt so nice.</p>
<p>Arousal +25</p><%s.vars.qArousal+=25;%>
<%}else if(s.tmp.args[2]==2 && s.tmp.args[3]=="Agility"){%>
<p>You quickly jump away from the vines and hurry on.</p>
<%}else if(s.tmp.args[2]==2 && s.tmp.args[3]=="Strength"){%>
<p>As the sprouts start to entwine your legs, you pull with all your might to rip them off.</p>
<%}%>
<%s.tmp.args[2]=0;%> 
<a0 onclick='window.story.show(window.story.state.DngSY.nextLocation)'>Next</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


:: WM_Lv1_VineGrab [_nosave_]
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
