:: WM_Lv1_SlugsDrop_Roll [_nosave_]
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_RollDebug")%>
<%if(window.story.state.tmp.args[2]==1 && window.story.state.vars.qUpperWear>0){window.story.state.vars.qUpperWear=0; %>
<p>You quickly pull your T-shirt over your head to see what hit you. You quickly pull your T-shirt over your head to see what has hit you. You discover a few slimy, finger-sized slugs squirming on your T-shirt. Disgusted, you drop it as you won't be wearing that again.  
Now your upper body is <b>NAKED</b>. </p>
<%}else if(window.story.state.tmp.args[2]==1 && window.story.state.vars.qUpperWear==0){%>
<p>Something sticks to your back and moves. You shake yourself and try to reach for it with your hands. Several of these purple slugs fall off on their own and you catch the rest with your hands.</p>
<p>Arousal +25</p><%window.story.state.vars.qArousal+=25;%>
<%}else if(s.tmp.args[2]==2 && s.tmp.args[3]=="Agility"){%>
<p>TODO</p>
<%}else if(s.tmp.args[2]==2 && s.tmp.args[3]=="Strength"){%>
<p>TODO</p>
<%}%>
<%window.story.state.tmp.args[2]=0;%> 
<a0 onclick='window.story.show(window.story.state.DngSY.nextLocation)'>Next</a>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>


