:: WM_Lv1_B1  [name:Elevator_1.floor]
<section><aside id="sidebar"></aside><article><%=window.story.render("CenterDialogs")%>
<%window.gm.player.location=window.passage.name;%>
<p>The second level of the mine has the same large tunnels carved into the rock like in the entry area.</p>
<a0 onclick='window.gm.player.location="WM_Lv1_A1",window.gm.triggerExploreEvt(window.gm.player.location)'>climb upstairs</a>
<%if(window.story.state.vars.WM_Lv.Explored[window.passage.name]>=4){%>
<p>You explored all corners of this area and might now decend [[down the stairs|WM_Lv1_C1]].</p><br>
<%}else{%>
<p>There are still some corners that you might need to <a0 onclick="window.gm.triggerExploreEvt(window.passage.name)">explore</a> to find a way deeper into the mine.<p>
<%}%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_Navigation")%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_Debug")%>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_Pickups")%>
</article><article id="LogPanel"></article></section>
<%=window.story.render("WM_Lv1_Encounters")%>


